// Axon Production AI Agent & Evaluation Harness Core (`std/ai_harness.ax`)
// 100% Pure Axon, Zero-GC, Zero Python/Node.js — High-Speed, Token-Optimized & Zero-Trust Hardened:
//   1. Auto-Growing Multi-Turn Context + True Text Compaction + Old-Tool-Output Token Compressor (`AgentContext`)
//   2. Auto-Growing Hash-Indexed Tool Registry + Cloudflare Code Mode Progressive Discovery (`ToolRegistry`)
//   3. Multi-Provider Chat Builders (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini) + Structural JSON-DOM Parallel Tool-Call Parser
//   4. Jailed Workspace Sandbox (streaming line-slice, full-file grep, strict ambiguity-checked edit + unified diff, safe-cmd)
//   5. O(N) Single-Pass Secret Redactor (API keys, JWTs, PEM blocks), Prompt-Injection Guard & Tool Result Cache
//   6. CRLF-Guarded Multi-Provider HTTPS Callers, Retry Policy, Circuit Breaker & Eval Summary

